  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Recently, there has been an increase in HMD devices with color passthrough capabilities, such as Quest 3 and Pico 4.\n\nConsidering the potential widespread adoption of future MR devices, how about adding a feature that offers a passthrough experience where only the avatar is displayed?\n\nIt would be ideal if users could seamlessly switch between the world view and the passthrough view with a single click, similar to the personal mirror or camera mask features.",
